          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">How is an SEO-ready site different from a regular one?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">An SEO-ready site is optimized from the source code up: fast loads, green Core Web Vitals, a sensible heading and URL structure, schema markup, and readiness for Google to crawl and index. A regular site usually only focuses on appearance.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">How long does web design take?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We send a draft in about 2 days. Full delivery: a landing page ~1 week; a statistic or blog site 1–2 weeks; an e-commerce site 3–4 weeks; webapps are quoted by scope.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">Will the site rank on Google right after it's built?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">SEO-ready design builds a strong technical foundation that makes ranking easier. However, rankings also depend on content and backlinks — that's the SEO work that comes after the site is finished.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">Does the price include domain and hosting?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The design price covers building the website. Domain and hosting are billed separately by the provider; HevaSEO advises and sets them up for free.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">Do I get the source code?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes. You own all the source code and admin accounts once payment is complete, along with operating instructions.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
